    rdfs:label "Digital Evidence Chain of Custody"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Forensic procedure preserving integrity and authenticity of digital evidence through cryptographic sealing and immutable logging from capture to legal presentation. bridges-to:: [[Blockchain]]"@en ;
