    rdfs:label "Pharmaceutical Traceability"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Blockchain-based pharmaceutical supply chain systems employing unit-level serialization, immutable audit trails, and automated verification to combat the £200 billion counterfeit medicine market causing over 1 million deaths annually, enabling DSCSA and EU FMD regulatory compliance, supporting MediLedger Network's 150+ million verification transactions (Pfizer, McKesson, AmerisourceBergen), and delivering 40-60% verification cost reductions whilst providing cold chain monitoring, clinical trial supply management, and controlled substance tracking."@en ;
    rdfs:subClassOf vf:blockchain ;
