    rdfs:comment "Economic activities and transactions that span multiple metaverse platforms and virtual worlds, enabled by interoperability standards, blockchain-based digital assets, and unified digital identity systems that allow users to buy, sell, trade, and transfer value seamlessly across different virtual environments."@en ;
