    rdfs:label "Digital Twin Construction"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "The application of digital twin technology within the architecture, engineering, and construction (AEC) industry, extending BIM capabilities through real-time sensor integration and IoT connectivity to create dynamic virtual replicas of buildings and infrastructure throughout their lifecycle. bridges-to:: [[Computer Vision]]"@en ;
