    vc:slug "3-d-reconstruction" ;
    vc:sourceDomain "spatial-computing" .

vf:ai-agent-system a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "AI Agent System"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "An autonomous software entity that perceives its environment through [[Sensor Input|sensors]], makes decisions using [[AI Techniques]], and takes actions to achieve specific goals, capable of [[Machine Learning|learning]] from experience and adapting [[Adaptive Behavior|behaviour]] over time. In 2025, AI agents have evolved to include [[Multi-Agent System|multi-agent coordination]], [[Tool Use]], [[Browser Automation]], and [[Blockchain Integration]] capabilities."@en ;
