    rdfs:comment "A method for training AI assistants to be harmless through self-improvement, using a set of principles or \"constitution\" to guide behaviour without human labels for harmful outputs. Constitutional AI combines supervised learning for self-critiques and revisions with RL from AI Feedback (RLAIF)."@en ;
